<title>CANADA: SASKATCHEWAN AG DETAILS HARVEST PROGRESS TO AUG 10.</title>
<headline>SASKATCHEWAN AG DETAILS HARVEST PROGRESS TO AUG 10.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saskatchewan Agriculture on Tuesday detailed the level of harvest progress to August 10.</p>
<p>		  SWATHED (PCT)  COMBINED (PCT)</p>
<p>		  Aug 10  92/96  Aug 10   92/96</p>
<p>Winter Wheat  16	22     47	 14</p>
<p>Spring Wheat   2	 1	1	  0</p>
<p>Durum Wheat    1	 0	1	  0</p>
<p>Oats	     3	 1	0	  0</p>
<p>Barley	   4	 1	0	  0</p>
<p>Fall Rye	18	36     70	 28</p>
<p>Spring Rye     9	 6	1	  0</p>
<p>Flax	     0	 0	0	  0</p>
<p>Canola	  13	 3	1	  1</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Reuters Winnipeg Bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
